Root cause:
The bug was caused by an improper handling of scan-element attributes that were meant to be hidden, which led to them not being included in the iio_channel's list of attributes. This caused failures during the extended name calculation when these hidden attributes had extended names in their filenames. The patch fixes this by adding these attributes to a separate list before the name calculation and ensures they are handled properly.
